WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:06.080
Oh. Hmm.

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:12.510
Aww, he's using his jacket as some kind of
security blanket.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:14.790
That's so cute and pathetic.

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:16.040
It really is.

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:17.640
You do you, weirdo.

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:22.620
Oh, hey, guys. I'm just sucking on my jacket.
A clump of honey candy got stuck right there

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:25.800
over a thousand years ago, and I can still
taste it.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.320
You know who I bet would like some of that? Me.

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:31.560
Zoidberg.

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:32.400
Oh, no.

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:37.830
Zoidberg, you residue hog. Now all I taste is
crab juice.

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:40.080
So, buy another jacket candy.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:44.880
I can't. They stopped making it after it got
reclassified as industrial glue.

00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:51.510
Ah. Then I, Bender will recreate the recipe. Don't
forget, I came in third on Master Chef Junior.

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:57.330
May I have a taste?

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:01.000
Sure. You seem like the kind of guy who has a
mouth.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:02.000
Whoa.

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:03.810
Diabetic coma.

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:07.620
I better add some sugar to make it less
sweet.

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:16.110
And just a touch of treacle to remind me of
my dear departed Aunt Juanita.

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:17.400
She drowned in treacle.

00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:20.520
You know I'm dying on the floor.

